{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "5d35ef60431251d70d7321748e48b9520eaaccf4a1359905ee13dd919e7d239c", "ja": "どんな言葉を書いたら、みんな喜んでくれるかな～。\n「フレー、フレー！　765プロ！」……とか？", "zh": "写些什么话，大家才会开心呢～  \n“加油，加油！765制作人！”……之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "84acca11d92aed9d95ee532251f7e3d7fa871c02afa3bc06c50e18d5b3fe8e01", "ja": "あっ。横断幕もだけど、衣装が一番大事だよね！\nみんながキラキラできる素敵な衣装がいいなぁ。", "zh": "啊。横幅当然也很重要，不过最重要的还是演出服吧！\n要是能有让大家都闪闪发光的漂亮演出服就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "06f074b916963238b760dc220e73c3d7d38729232a4860cf76c8dcae55b903c4", "ja": "フレー、フレー！　みーさーき！\nファイト、ファイト！　美咲ーっ！", "zh": "加油，加油！美咲——！\n加油，加油！美咲——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1003_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0c672f03f2b4d57bd1255f3cb19617985c015b94aae587bdd95bd28608f9cc1e", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。……あれ？\n賑やかな声がしましたが、青羽さんおひとりですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。……咦？\n刚才好像听到了热闹的声音，青羽小姐是一个人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "3d8ec95a7ec7cc2fe2dae7ea7ec7d6d8b9f02bd6dae30789cc2fa710fed8659d", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}さん！\nえへへ……聞こえちゃいました？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n嘿嘿……被听到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "80bbffc98b4f2ce2665ad0606b998ad30fae97cbcad512786836e7126505d117", "ja": "その、気合いを入れていたんです。\n劇場のみんなのために、私も頑張らないとって。", "zh": "那个，我刚才是在给自己打气。\n想着为了剧场的大家，我也必须努力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a71fc20e59db0c8ff98d283bb7214287f9b836459cf2b57b676fbb39dc9d7f04", "ja": "そうだったんですか。\n何か気合いを入れるようなことが？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n是发生了什么需要打起精神来的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "860157520d685abbf7a346ec4599be2610c935cc987d0bd9fb63d26602e4e088", "ja": "実は、大きなライブが……あっ！　社長さんから\n「早く来てほしい」ってお電話があったんでした！", "zh": "其实是有场大型演出……啊！我想起来社长\n打电话来说“希望你快点过来”了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "75db08fbc2acc60c0f6cc024cec9d809f2d466209a5679973eddf1cda230fdfd", "ja": "詳しいお話は、そちらで聞いてください！", "zh": "详细情况请到那边去听吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "bc782f38bff63ee289262239bb501e33389c93f95790d4d9d15b83b6244bfe88", "ja": "社長から？　伝言ありがとうございます！\nさっそく、事務所に行ってみます！", "zh": "社长那边？　谢谢您转告！\n我这就去事务所看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "6362e873593fca912275ce6391721ee932e5bbc9bb770a3235a40967e1c89b69", "ja": "はーい、行ってらっしゃいー！　\nフレー、フレー、{$P$}さーん♪", "zh": "好——慢走！给{$P$}先生加油、加油♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "06d69dbaefae2e1432cd60d8cdf8d3fa442bbda914c09bafa83a4a8babdf03b7", "ja": "ううっ。まだ連絡はないかね、音無君？\nメールとか届いてないかね？", "zh": "呜呜，还没有消息吗，音无君？  \n有没有收到邮件之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "4de99d553d060ea6889f4475dd9be6d14a84af1d0ebdf2975c332083ce84170c", "ja": "社長！　早くお話がしたい気持ちはわかります。\nでも、少し落ち着かれた方が……。", "zh": "社长！我理解您迫不及待想聊的心情。\n不过，还是请您稍微冷静一下……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "fd99bc2a9971c169109237ae4462cd4daf2d1c92d6a50f6fbed748aa88ffbcbb", "ja": "そ、そうだね。どっしりと構えなくては。\nだが、年甲斐もなくソワソワしてしまってね……。", "zh": "是、是啊。必须沉住气才行。  \n可是，明明一把年纪了，我却还是坐立不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1016_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "35bbf1e05b8b996ac2b11a14071155e2570e39d7669feac6a56f7b5e12631a52", "ja": "お疲れさまです、音無さん、社ちょ……。", "zh": "辛苦了，音无小姐，社长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "dd00785b3f19a2fca5984d4d19a08293da2d81bb97eb6ec3330397174b657acd", "ja": "おお！　首を長ーくして待っていたよ、君！\nいやはや、これでやっと話ができるというものだ。", "zh": "哦哦！我可是望眼欲穿地等着你呢！  \n哎呀呀，这下终于能好好聊聊了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "74aca96a9907415ea13ba97b5c32abd6dbce3b9e2ec8550bb5150892f14ffd91", "ja": "っと……すごい勢いですね。\nそんなに、いい話があったんですか？", "zh": "呃……气势真足啊。\n难道有那么好的消息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "e93884c58caad411dd0120bb9332602ffabf063bf7bb6ddf2d68430e0460fb3a", "ja": "そうなんです、{$P$}さん！\nそれはもう、とっても大事な……。", "zh": "就是这样，{$P$}先生！那可是非常重要的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "3a05c185f815348796eafb9b54d4f9a944b5cba28ee40ac376fc4ed8564530c8", "ja": "音無君、先に言わないでくれよ！　……コホンッ！\n実は、事務所の垣根を越えた大きな企画が始動してね。", "zh": "音无，别先说出来啊！……咳咳！其实，一个跨越事务所界限的大型企划已经启动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "4be3b8e90ea8383aad354a9eb634ab8175d70841e78b623f9b603414221bb894", "ja": "数多のアイドル達が集う合同ライブが決定したんだ。\nその名も『MASTERS OF IDOL WORLD』！", "zh": "已经决定要举办一场众多偶像齐聚的联合演唱会。\n名字就叫“MASTERS OF IDOL WORLD”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1d0b22fcb0789379f674149b2c67ce576efd9e16b48750bad758a2c6ac83bf94", "ja": "『MASTERS OF IDOL WORLD』……！\n名前からして、すごそうな企画ですね！", "zh": "『MASTERS OF IDOL WORLD』……！\n光是这个名字，就感觉是个不得了的企划呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "e0d8e7c9ae9750e20a1cbc2c48437b76a1677086fa984f36c1471d746ff78ffa", "ja": "そうだろう？　参加している事務所も実に多彩でね。\n今までウチと交流のあった事務所をはじめとして……。", "zh": "是吧？参加的事务所也确实多种多样。\n其中有和我们事务所有过交流的事务所……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "2a92cc984b5ecfdebf442129cd77cd03683460c265c05fe2a963c36824db1c86", "ja": "他にも、男性アイドルの多い315プロダクションや、\n新進気鋭の283プロダクションなども参加している！", "zh": "此外，男性偶像众多的315事务所，以及新锐的283事务所等也参加了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1026_101kot", "source_sha256": "80799366e017a6207b8bd2330cf0101ae8ff7f9178458ffe85f84f302b0f49fa", "ja": "ふふっ、聞いたことのある事務所ばかりですね！\nアイドルのお祭りって感じで、ワクワクしちゃいます！", "zh": "呵呵，都是些听说过的事务所呢！\n感觉就像是偶像的庆典一样，让人兴奋不已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "74ecb36f2e8acc732e74c512f4fe6134d6a8c386d7b7bf76f797ec1b82c91927", "ja": "それで社長、そのライブに765プロも……？", "zh": "那么，社长，765事务所也会参加那场演唱会吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "be3b4b3c013c606108fea6232206e05cbcc1ebc9d01806244e4d2b680da1f7c9", "ja": "もちろん！　我が765プロからは天海君達が出場する\n予定だが、加えて、劇場の代表として……。", "zh": "当然了！虽然我们765事务所预定是由天海君她们出场，\n但除此以外，作为剧场的代表……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "d6f2c17ce4d5dea7dea79afcf4386af07b5a7c8a9510dd009cee1909ef181dec", "ja": "春日未来君、最上静香君、伊吹翼君にも参加してもら\nおうと思っている。君、サポートを頼めるかね？", "zh": "我打算让春日未来、最上静香和伊吹翼也参与进来。你能帮忙提供支持吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "db8927af4b57f8f67166895da7736e69ba2253b19763890588577a41fb26c37a", "ja": "なるほど。未来達にも、いい経験になりそうですね。\nわかりました。全力で取り組みます！", "zh": "原来如此。对未来她们来说，似乎也会是一次很好的经历。\n明白了。我会全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "6dbbd38673f3f8869b979baa187843ea9280604e9841233bd5f160ab0e51d45b", "ja": "うむ、よろしく頼むよ！！", "zh": "嗯，那就拜托你了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1032_101kot", "source_sha256": "f1b1c07b26b0f4164ed19c7a97e788ae885f630962c22aa085c8acf5453bfaad", "ja": "あの、社長？　お話がまとまりかけてますけど……\n曲をお渡ししなくていいんですか？", "zh": "那个，社长？虽然事情好像快要谈妥了……\n不过，不用把乐曲交出去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1033_president", "source_sha256": "8a8a6e384891bf190a4bf1de69cdd07e287992b3812a052c06ca681a58bdea9a", "ja": "おお、そうだったそうだった！　ありがとう、音無君。\nまずは、この曲を聞いてくれたまえ。", "zh": "哦，对了对了！谢谢你，音无。\n先听听这首歌吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1035_p", "source_sha256": "5e55380e27f724415244b5c2daf91985d3445acf68360ecdbd9eca064205a15d", "ja": "おおっ！　この曲が、合同ライブ用の新曲ですか？", "zh": "哦！这首歌就是为联合演唱会准备的新歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1036_president", "source_sha256": "173b13adea7eee8e068c6f3cbaae5b9ae1e5feddd99718707aab9ce136e5ad0d", "ja": "正解、と言いたいところだが惜しい！　この曲は、\nライブに参加したアイドル全員が歌う曲なのだよ。", "zh": "本来想说回答正确，不过还差一点！这首歌是参加演出的所有偶像一起演唱的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_intro_1037_p", "source_sha256": "aa2523c32f4ae0c51e2d4886271a2b9cd6c7c3cb12c17b40efbd17371d0ea1fb", "ja": "なるほど、このイベントのテーマ曲みたいなもの\nですか。面白い試みですね！", "zh": "原来如此，也就是这次活动的主题曲之类的吧。真是个有趣的尝试呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
